    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on the 21st October 2005 the erection of a detached outbuilding within the rear garden to measure 8.5m in length by 7m width by 3.8m height at the ridge was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:",
